{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203410","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320341001:1":{"text":"て、てめえら……よくも俺が雇った傭兵を……治療費を払うのはこっちなんだぞ！","source_cn":"你们这群混账……居然打伤了我这么多佣兵！这可都是要赔钱的！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBB7010E8F965A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320341002:1":{"text":"おい！みんな見ろよ！これがエフゲルニアとレフスキーの本性だ！借りた金は返さねえし、しまいには暴力まで振るいやがる！","source_cn":"左邻右舍都来瞧瞧，这就是老叶甫根尼和列夫斯基的行事作风...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84DCC26C9EEFD993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320341003:1":{"text":"なっ！？そっちが先に手を出したくせに！","source_cn":"什么啊？！明明是你先动的手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A68D3765D44A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320341004:1":{"text":"はっ！そもそもよ、レフスキーの野郎、孤高の画家を気取って訳の分からねえ芸術論をぬかしては、毎日毎日貴族どもに媚びへつらいやがって！","source_cn":"得了吧！你们说说列夫斯基这个人，从前自诩清高，满嘴都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67863B5563304931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320341005:1":{"text":"なのに、病気になったあいつを見舞いに来たお偉いさんが一人でもいたか？しまいにや、親切心で金を貸してやった俺たちの借金を踏み倒そうとしやがる！","source_cn":"他病倒之后，那些老爷可没一个过来探望的，只有我们这些好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9C8DA14FD44919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320341006:1":{"text":"あいつが病気になったのも、神罰が下ったのかもしれねえなあ！","source_cn":"要我说啊，他得的病就是神明的惩罚！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8EDCEB73991541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320341007:1":{"text":"な、何だと！？","source_cn":"你……你瞎说什么！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16CE0900C2983E8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320341008:1":{"text":"いい加減諦めろよ、エフゲルニア。こいつらがずっとてめえを助けてくれるわけでもねえだろ。","source_cn":"哼，老叶甫根尼，我劝你早点认命。这些多管闲事的人早晚要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89D1E6C450052C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320341009:1":{"text":"俺にも我慢の限界があるんだ。痛い目みたくなけりゃ――","source_cn":"可别惹急了我，不然我真对你动——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F552962FD71202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320341010:1":{"text":"今、「病気になったのは神罰が下ったからだ」と言ったか？","source_cn":"你刚才说，“生病是神明的惩罚”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA698600D74CAF22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320341011:1":{"text":"それはどういう意味だ？よければ詳しく説明してくれないだろうか？","source_cn":"这句话是什么意思？我不太理解，想请你解释一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A42878255711F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320341012:1":{"text":"な、なななな……生きた屍！？","source_cn":"你、你你你……是活死人！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA1EA3B398D601ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320341013:1":{"text":"まだ僕の質問に答えてもらってないぞ。","source_cn":"你还没回答我的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44CB4BF267B0A2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320341014:1":{"text":"も、もももうここには二度と来ねえよ！だ、だから勘弁してくれええ！","source_cn":"我……我……我不会再来了！放过我吧！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1320240089F93887","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320341015:1":{"text":"まっ、逃げ足だけは速いんですから！","source_cn":"哼……跑得倒是够快的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAB8F66B5FFC8D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:讨债的商人":{"text":"借金取りの商人","source":"讨债的商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロン